{"id":"0c5e4aaa7e95ef90","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbposiconflict.md","title":"Posiform的加权项冲突图","display":"df-pbposiconflict — Posiform的加权项冲突图","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbposiconflict","aliases":["27-df-pbposiconflict"],"display":"df-pbposiconflict — Posiform的加权项冲突图","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbnf]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.4.4","source_printed_pages":"591","source_pdf_pages":"615","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbposiconflict"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbposiconflict</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbposiconflict — Posiform的加权项冲突图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"34c60c3bc15859dd\" href=\"?note=34c60c3bc15859dd\" title=\"27-df-pbnf\">27-df-pbnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.4.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"591"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"615"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\">\\(P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"34c60c3bc15859dd\" href=\"?note=34c60c3bc15859dd\" title=\"27-df-pbnf\">27-df-pbnf</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[m]=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\">\\([m]=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_P\\coloneqq\\{\\{k,\\ell\\}:k,\\ell\\in[m],\\ k\\ne\\ell,\\ (A_k\\cap B_\\ell)\\cup(B_k\\cap A_\\ell)\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\qquad G_P\\coloneqq([m],E_P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_P\\coloneqq\\{\\{k,\\ell\\}:k,\\ell\\in[m],\\ k\\ne\\ell,\\ (A_k\\cap B_\\ell)\\cup(B_k\\cap A_\\ell)\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\qquad G_P\\coloneqq([m],E_P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I_P\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq[m]:\\forall e\\in E_P\\;(e\\nsubseteq S)\\},\\qquad\\alpha_P\\coloneqq\\max_{S\\in\\mathcal I_P}\\sum_{k\\in S}b_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I_P\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq[m]:\\forall e\\in E_P\\;(e\\nsubseteq S)\\},\\qquad\\alpha_P\\coloneqq\\max_{S\\in\\mathcal I_P}\\sum_{k\\in S}b_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>顶点是项的序列位置，重复项仍为不同加权顶点。冲突恰是某坐标被要求同时为0和1。空集稳定，m=0时最大值仍定义且为0。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbnf","status":"resolved","id":"34c60c3bc15859dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbnf","status":"resolved","id":"34c60c3bc15859dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n$，见 [[27-df-pbnf]]；$[m]=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n","display":false},{"tex":"[m]=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}","display":false},{"tex":"E_P\\coloneqq\\{\\{k,\\ell\\}:k,\\ell\\in[m],\\ k\\ne\\ell,\\ (A_k\\cap B_\\ell)\\cup(B_k\\cap A_\\ell)\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\qquad G_P\\coloneqq([m],E_P).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal I_P\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq[m]:\\forall e\\in E_P\\;(e\\nsubseteq S)\\},\\qquad\\alpha_P\\coloneqq\\max_{S\\in\\mathcal I_P}\\sum_{k\\in S}b_k.","display":true}],"bytes":1242,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbposiconflict|df-pbposiconflict — Posiform的加权项冲突图]]"},{"id":"e020171435fa55d1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$r\\in\\mathbb N$，$V=[r]$，$E\\subseteq\\{\\{u,v\\}:u,v\\in V,u\\ne v\\}$，$w:V\\to\\mathbb R_{>0}$。每条边$e\\in E$选定有序端点$(u_e,v_e)$且$\\{u_e,v_e\\}=e$；空积为1。[[27-df-pbposiconflict]] 的冲突概念不依赖坐标重编号。"},{"id":"90beadd9d7ce40a3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBPolarForms}_n$（[[27-df-pbpolar]]），$E_P$ 见 [[27-df-pbposiconflict]]。"},{"id":"c576c358aa272616","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)$；$\\mathrm{Posiform}_n,\\mathrm{PBEval}_n$ 及冲突图的 $\\mathcal I_P,\\alpha_P$ 见 [[27-df-pbposiconflict]] 及其上游 [[27-df-pbnf]]。"}],"outgoing":["34c60c3bc15859dd"]}